{"title":"Binxonia Guard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Binxonia Guard is a guard — a named <a href=\"#/monster/human\">Human</a> seen at level 1–40 (warrior).</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p>The <a href=\"#/guide/outfits\">Iron Plate</a> outfit, and</p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Iron Fullhelm</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Iron Torso</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>arms</i> Iron Arms</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Iron Legs</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Iron Feet</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Iron Sword</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>off hand</i> Iron Shield</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Binxonia Guard</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"binxonia-guard\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Other named Humans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/banker\">Banker</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/stablemaster\">Stablemaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/james-hookman\">James Hookman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Harbormaster Orla Quayle</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/hollis-tamber\">Hollis Tamber</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/exchange-clerk\">Exchange Clerk</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/tailor\">Tailor</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/jill-appleseed\">Jill Appleseed</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/osric-blane\">Osric Blane</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/gerald-seabroden\">Gerald Seabroden</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/graden-tallspout\">Graden Tallspout</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/squiremaster\">Squiremaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/wilson-barthrone\">Wilson Barthrone</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/archery-vendor\">Archery Vendor</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/guildmaster\">G